    if(direct){let reconciling=false,reconcileQueued=false;const reconcileImages=()=>{if(reconciling||reconcileQueued)return;reconcileQueued=true;queueMicrotask(()=>{reconcileQueued=false;if(!direct.isConnected)return;reconciling=true;const promoted=promoteLooseImages(direct);mountImageBlocks(direct);if(promoted){const value=renderedToMarkdown(direct);ta.value=value;if(!repairPastedImageText(m,value,next=>{ta.value=next;direct.innerHTML=md(next);mountImageBlocks(direct);persistNote(m,next);}))persistNote(m,value);}reconciling=false;});};const imageObserver=new MutationObserver(reconcileImages);imageObserver.observe(direct,{childList:true,subtree:true});direct.addEventListener("input",()=>{promoteLooseImages(direct);mountImageBlocks(direct);ta.value=renderedToMarkdown(direct);if(repairPastedImageText(m,ta.value,value=>{ta.value=value;direct.innerHTML=md(value);mountImageBlocks(direct);persistNote(m,value);}))return;persistNote(m,ta.value);});direct.addEventListener("keydown",e=>{if(e.key!==" ")return;const sel=getSelection(),node=sel&&sel.anchorNode,el=node&&(node.nodeType===3?node.parentElement:node),block=el&&el.closest("p,div");if(!block||!/^#{1,6}$/.test(block.textContent.trim()))return;e.preventDefault();const h=document.createElement("h"+block.textContent.trim().length);h.innerHTML="<br>";block.replaceWith(h);const range=document.createRange();range.selectNodeContents(h);range.collapse(true);sel.removeAllRanges();sel.addRange(range);direct.dispatchEvent(new Event("input"));});reconcileImages();}
